Market Challenges
The industry faces several notable headwinds that require strategic navigation:
Price Sensitivity and Brand Loyalty Challenges
With approximately 30% of buyers prioritizing affordability over brand reputation, premium labels struggle to maintain pricing power. The market has seen significant disruption from digital-native brands offering comparable quality at lower price points through direct-to-consumer models.
Size Inclusivity Gaps
An ongoing industry challenge remains the availability of extended sizing options. Consumer surveys reveal that 45% of plus-size shoppers report difficulty finding well-fitting shapewear bodysuits, representing both a service gap and significant market opportunity for size-inclusive brands.
